@tasktracker_api = https://localhost:7134
@tasktracker_mvc_api = https://localhost:7145

### Health - Standalone API
GET {{tasktracker_api}}/api/health

### Health (v1) - Standalone API
GET {{tasktracker_api}}/api/v1/health

### List tasks (v1) - Standalone API
GET {{tasktracker_api}}/api/v1/tasks

### Create task (v1) - Standalone API
POST {{tasktracker_api}}/api/v1/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Prepare sprint review",
  "description": "Collect demo notes",
  "assignee": "Alex",
  "priority": "High"
}

### Update task (v1) - Standalone API
PUT {{tasktracker_api}}/api/v1/tasks/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Prepare sprint review",
  "description": "Collect demo notes and blockers",
  "assignee": "Alex",
  "priority": "Medium"
}

### Health - MVC app API surface
GET {{tasktracker_mvc_api}}/api/health

### List tasks (v1) - MVC app API surface
GET {{tasktracker_mvc_api}}/api/v1/tasks
